# Mirror inbox guard (mirror-sync-manifest category 10): transit inbox entries are
# local hub-spoke comms and should NOT land in the public mirror. Ignore the whole
# _inbox/ tree INCLUDING the done/ archive — inbox archives can carry client-topic
# names, which must not reach a public repo (data protection). The tracked scaffold
# (README + the Hello-world example) is kept. Note: .gitignore never untracks files
# already committed; this only stops new/untracked inbox files from being staged.
_inbox/*
!_inbox/README.md
!_inbox/done/
_inbox/done/*
!_inbox/done/Hello-world.md
# Belt-and-suspenders: never stage an AISA inbox file even outside _inbox/ (matches
# the date-prefixed 2026-10-06_AISA-work.md, not just a bare AISA-work.md).
*AISA-work.md
